{
    "description": "Remembers the git HEAD at the start of a session, and takes git snapshots of the working tree at each prompt and answer (a temporary index and refs/coders-talk/<session>; your branch, index and files are not touched), so /coders-talk:build can show which code each turn changed and what you changed by hand. When auto mode is on for this computer (/coders-talk:auto), sends the session in the background while it runs (every ten minutes of work), when it ends, and at the next start if it never said it ended; otherwise sends nothing. Once per session, when the agent used Builds from the Coders Talk library and the session changed code, the Stop hook shows you a line suggesting to share it (it sends nothing; CODERS_TALK_NUDGE=0 turns it off).",
    "hooks": {
        "SessionStart": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session-start.mjs\"",
                        "timeout": 10
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/snapshot.mjs\" start",
                        "timeout": 10
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "UserPromptSubmit": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/snapshot.mjs\" prompt",
                        "timeout": 10
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Stop": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/stop.mjs\"",
                        "timeout": 10
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/snapshot.mjs\" stop",
                        "timeout": 10
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "SessionEnd": [
            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/session-end.mjs\"",
                        "timeout": 10
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
